From 7aa8776d6bdb1166ee2e2a402e4fe38c0170967c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: sneezeparty <38020091+sneezeparty@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 10:24:11 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 7/8] plugins/screencast: Let the client choose how often
 hidden windows update

stream_desktop carries the number of updates per second for windows
that are not on screen, 1 by default and at most 30. A window with
several throttled references draws at the rate of the fastest one.
Replaces the KWIN_THROTTLED_OFFSCREEN_INTERVAL environment variable.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
